"You㉗<I>did</I>㉔help me, more than you know. You were a <I>good</I> son."

pt:
//【統】
<voice name='統' class='統' src='voice/ma05/0201450b46'>
//「いっぱい助けてもらったさ……
//　孝行息子」
"Você㉗<I>me ajudou</I>㉔, mais do que imagina. Você foi um <I>bom</I> filho."

en:
//【統】
<voice name='統' class='統' src='voice/ma05/0201460b46'>
//「だから……わたしはもういいから。
//　あいつを頼むよ……」
"So forget about me... It's her you need to think about now..."

pt:
//【統】
<voice name='統' class='統' src='voice/ma05/0201460b46'>
//「だから……わたしはもういいから。
